Fonts in this folder
====================

These three faces are here only so tools/make-tags.py can trace eight words
into SVG outlines for the Wash wall (wall.py, tag_paths.py). They are a build
input: no font file is ever served, linked or embedded by the site, and no
@font-face refers to them.

Sedgwick Ave — SedgwickAve.woff2
Sedgwick Ave Display — SedgwickAveDisplay.woff2
    Copyright 2017 The Sedgwick Ave Project Authors
    https://github.com/googlefonts/sedgwickave
    SIL Open Font License 1.1 — https://scripts.sil.org/OFL
    The OFL permits use, study, modification and redistribution, including of
    derivative works such as traced outlines. It forbids selling the fonts on
    their own and requires that any derived *font* keep the licence and not
    use the Reserved Font Name. tag_paths.py is artwork, not a font, and the
    site ships no font file, so neither obligation lands on the build — the
    attribution above is kept all the same.

